WEBVTT

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:38.480
Didn't Coach Mitaka
show up that day... ?

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:43.340
Or...

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:03.210
Ms. Otonashi!

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:05.400
Please! Wake up, Ms. Otonashi!

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:10.250
You're supposed to answer
my proposal today.

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:12.870
How could you be so rude?

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:17.660
Forget it!

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:27.680
I doubt it, but...

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:48.770
All right, all right!

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:51.530
Hello? Ikkoku.

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:53.340
Is that you, Mrs. Ichinose?

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:54.400
Good.

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:56.370
It's you!

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:57.620
It's me, Mitaka.

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:02.130
Uh... How's Ms. Otonashi doing?

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.550
Whaddaya mean?

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:07.410
You know, like...
does she seem upset?

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:11.060
Well...hold it a sec!

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:17.280
Good morning.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:20.370
Um...

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.800
She's still mad at me
about staying out all night.

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:33.090
Hello? What's going on?
Mrs. Ichinose?

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:36.370
She seems upset, all right.

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:37.590
I knew it.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:40.490
It's not your problem.

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:44.120
Are you kidding?!
It's all my fault.

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:45.180
Why?

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:48.590
We had a date the other day...

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:54.400
but I suddenly fell ill
and couldn't make it.

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:58.560
Oh. I'll go get her.
Tell her your self.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:02.610
No! I just wanted to know
how she's doing.

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:03.940
Bye!

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:10.470
Something's fishy.

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:13.560
What? Coach Mitaka?

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:17.640
When I told him I'd get you,
he suddenly hung up.

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:19.020
Oh.

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:20.790
So I was right.

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:22.060
Ms. Otonashi!

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:23.930
Please! Wake up, Ms. Otonashi!

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.230
Ms. Otonashi!

00:04:25.810 --> 00:04:27.760
You're gonna spill
that hot water.

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:31.980
Did something happen between
you and Coach Mitaka?

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:33.050
Well...

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:36.350
I fell asleep on
a very important day.

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:37.980
"Very important day"?

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:40.750
Like you were supposed to answer
his marriage proposal or somethin'?

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:41.680
Uh-huh.

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:49.320
M-Mitaka proposed to Kyoko?!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:52.420
It must have been official.

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.080
So what did the Manager say?

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:58.160
She didn't deny it, so
she must have said "yes."

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:02.370
Then it's time Godai
steps down like a man.

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:03.610
Yeah.

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:08.430
There's nothing more pathetic
than a guy who just won't go away.

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:10.500
Remember, the other day?

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.490
She was waiting for Godai
with a feast ready?

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:14.850
She even had wine!

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:19.490
I bet she wanted to
discuss it with Godai.

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:21.680
But the guy never
came home 'til morning!

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:23.310
That was surely
the deciding factor.

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:26.420
Godai never had a chance anyway.

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:28.930
No... No way..!

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:32.620
C'mon! Make up your mind!

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:35.110
I've been telling you!

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.230
I have no desire to marry Asuna.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:39.180
Give me one good reason!

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:45.980
I'm...

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.200
I'm in love with someone.

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:51.010
How far have you
gone with her?

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:52.810
"How far"?

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:55.120
Have you two made
plans to marry?

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:57.920
No. We've had our reasons.

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:03.500
Are you sure she loves you?

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:09.760
She seems upset, all right.

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:14.060
Shun! What don't you
like about Asuna?

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:17.570
You won't find fine young ladies
like that anymore.

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:23.310
I'm not leaving here
without a good explanation.

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:27.860
I'm a pretty understanding man,
you know.

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:33.020
C'mon, Shun!

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:34.540
All right!

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:39.000
All right.
I have no choice now.

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:41.370
I'll tell you the truth.

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:45.970
But you have to promise me, Uncle,
that you'd never tell a soul.

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:48.430
What is it?

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:56.380
T-The fact is...

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:58.120
I don't like dogs.

00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:00.180
What? I couldn't
hear what you said.

00:07:00.260 --> 00:07:01.860
What don't you like?

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:03.350
I don't like dogs.

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:05.450
WHAT don't you like?

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:08.390
DOGS! I don't like dogs!

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:10.180
I HATE THEM!!

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:14.120
You hate dogs?

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:18.810
Th-That's right.
That's why I can't--

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.740
I was wondering what
you were going to say.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:26.990
You think an excuse like that
will get you off the hook?

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:31.680
You better learn to lie
better than that!

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:32.980
I'm not lying!

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:34.180
I really--

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:37.490
Listen, if you marry into
the wealth of the Kujo family...

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:39.890
our family will enjoy
extra security.

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:42.870
That's like marrying
solely for political gain!

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:44.020
That's right.

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:54.050
I can't talk to her at the
apartment 'cause of those bozos.

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:56.480
I can ask her
to meet me somewhere.

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:58.850
She won't show.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:00.610
A letter...?

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:02.310
Too depressing.

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:04.990
I'll wait for her somewhere!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.750
She'll think I'm a stalker.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.230
Isn't there a way?

00:08:12.690 --> 00:08:18.060
I have to tell her my true feelings
before she gives Mitaka her answer.

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:22.620
She hasn't said a word
to me since that day.

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:24.560
Mr. Godai!

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:26.240
Mr. Godai!

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:29.480
What is it, Kyoko?

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:31.950
What's this?

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:35.300
Gimme an answer, 'kay?
It's a pinky promise!

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:38.120
Pinky promise!

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:41.690
Kyon-Kyon loves you,
Mr. Godai!

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:44.990
When I grow up,
I wanna be your bride!

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:47.150
It's an audio love-letter!

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:48.830
Kids love you, Godai!

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:52.760
Kids have it so easy.
They're so honest.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:56.520
And Kyon-Kyon is
very good at cooking.

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:57.900
Don't forget
to answer me, 'kay?!

00:08:57.980 --> 00:08:59.000
Love, Kyon-Kyon.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:14.010
Ms. Otonashi!

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:16.820
Coach Mitaka.

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:21.190
A-About the other day...

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:23.200
--I'm sorry.
--I'm sorry.

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:25.240
Um--

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:29.400
It was my fault.

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:31.900
No, it was me.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.000
There you are, Shun!

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:39.320
What are you
doing here, Uncle?

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:42.250
Your date with Asuna
is confirmed.

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:44.750
I wanted to let you know
as soon as I could.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:47.860
Uncle! Stop it!

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:52.220
Why not?! You're eventually
going to end up together.

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:56.230
You should start planning
for your future together.

00:09:56.300 --> 00:09:58.020
I have no intention to--!

00:09:58.370 --> 00:10:00.610
Well, if you'll excuse me...

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:03.760
M-Ms. Otonashi!

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:08.740
Shun! If she wants to go,
let her go.

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:27.520
If the marriage arrangement
is going well...

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:30.200
why couldn't he
just tell me so?

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:35.530
I Feel...

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:38.840
sort of relieved.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:41.800
But sort of sad.

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:44.620
What a strange feeling.

00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:48.640
You're back early.

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:51.510
Did everything go well
with Coach Mitaka?

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:53.220
W-Well...

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:03.520
H-Hello.

00:11:03.610 --> 00:11:04.390
Welcome back.

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:06.260
She's talking to me!

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:07.660
Here's my chance!

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:09.900
Um--

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:13.140
I'm deeply sorry
about what happened.

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:14.540
About what?

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:15.700
You know...

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:18.400
...that night when
I didn't come home.

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:20.170
Oh, that?
Forget about it.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:21.400
You mean--

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:23.580
It's done and over with.

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:26.320
Done and over with?

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:30.780
She said it's over.

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:33.730
So get over it, or she'll
start to hate you!

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:36.330
If it doesn't kill you,
it'll make you stronger!

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:42.920
Damn them! Finding joy
in my misfortune!

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:55.980
Don't forget to
answer me, 'kay?

00:11:56.890 --> 00:11:59.860
You better keep
your promises with kids.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.960
Kids are very delicate.

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:03.950
I know, but...

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:07.190
I'm in no mood to--

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:14.780
This is it!

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:34.630
Okay. That's good enough
for the kid.

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:39.870
All right. Here I go.

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:48.800
Kyoko, please listen
to what I have to say.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:51.360
Too gloomy.

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.230
This isn't a life
or death situation.

00:12:53.740 --> 00:12:55.860
Better to be cheerful.

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:00.920
Sorry I haven't been
seeing you much...

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:03.680
since I've started
working part-time!

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:06.200
I sound like an idiot.

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:11.350
But it's not that I've
been forgetting you.

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:15.560
As a matter of fact
I've started saving money.

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:17.820
Do you know what
I'm saving for?

00:13:18.140 --> 00:13:19.090
Saving money?!

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:22.100
May I borrow some?

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:27.810
Let me borrow some, please?!

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:35.650
Sorry about that.

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:41.650
I'm just a poor student
attending a third-rate college.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:44.060
I graduate next year...

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:46.920
but I can't get a great job
at a top-notch firm.

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:49.830
So, for a guy with
an uncertain future...

00:13:49.910 --> 00:13:52.070
to propose to you is--

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:54.730
I'm starting to feel
sorry for myself.

00:13:55.280 --> 00:14:01.070
I'm tired of living
the poor life!

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.040
A-Akemi!

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:05.690
How 'bout a duet, Godai?

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:08.690
A karaoke party?

00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:10.320
No, it's not!

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:12.210
If you want to ease
your heartache...

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:14.250
it's best to drown your
sorrow in booze.

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:16.270
Who has a heartache?!

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:20.930
A lonely man's howling
echoes through the night.

00:14:21.070 --> 00:14:23.220
A man and a woman's
unresolved feelings...

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:25.770
bring tears night after night.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:28.960
How pathetic...
What a shame!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:30.640
Here I go!

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:33.050
Akemi Roppongi will serenade you
with this first number!

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:34.470
Yes!

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.180
Jeez.

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:13.020
What brings you here
so early in the morning?

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:15.280
Mitaka!

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:18.620
I just had to see you.

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:22.710
Uh... Would you like
to come inside?

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:30.490
Thank you, no. I have
to go to my date's house.

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:32.830
Oh, yes. A date.

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:35.070
I'm going to turn her down
today, for sure.

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:38.500
I'm going to
break it off with her.

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:42.650
And after I do, I'd like
to hear your answer, please.

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:47.340
Her answer?

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:49.740
To his proposal?

00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:58.720
Listen, Ms. Otonashi.

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:02.220
I'm going to turn
her down for you.

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:04.200
For you.

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:07.540
"for you"?

00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:09.400
Wow. Now that's a proposal.

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:12.370
That was a bold move.

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:15.320
The Manager looks pretty moved.

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:22.420
For me?

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:25.220
Manager.

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:44.400
Kyoko, please listen 'til the end.

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:49.310
If you decide to get married,
I can't stop you.

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:55.080
But before you make that choice,
I need you to know how I feel.

00:16:56.450 --> 00:17:02.830
It's more than love. Words can't
describe how I feel about you.

00:17:03.900 --> 00:17:10.050
I get an indescribable feeling
every time you smile at me.

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:13.460
So... Well...

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:17.060
I wish that someday,

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:20.300
you'd feel the same about me.

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:28.120
That's the kind of man
I want to become.

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:33.120
Asuna, Coach Mitaka is here.

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:35.750
She's been so looking
forward to seeing you.

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:37.350
She's making herself pretty.

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:38.690
Is that so?

00:17:39.340 --> 00:17:42.430
Asuna! Coach Mitaka is
waiting for you.

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:43.550
I'm coming.

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:51.880
I'm sorry. It took me a while
to get everyone ready.

00:17:52.740 --> 00:17:55.110
Everyone?

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:58.120
You're not planning to
take your dogs with you?

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.280
Can't I?

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:04.690
Of course not. What in the
world are you thinking?

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:05.620
Isn't that so?

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:07.690
Huh?

00:18:07.990 --> 00:18:09.540
Are you all right?

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:12.660
Well, I'll be taking
your daughter out.

00:18:17.940 --> 00:18:20.400
Good-bye, Mother!

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:32.950
I can't believe this girl!

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:43.690
Oh, my. They must really
want to come along.

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:45.700
Asuna, I'm going
to drive faster!

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:57.030
I'm going to turn
her down for you.

00:18:59.190 --> 00:19:00.410
For you.

00:19:06.090 --> 00:19:06.700
Yes?

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:09.350
Godai.

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:10.770
Manager.

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.880
This...is how I truly feel.

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:15.750
Bye.

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:19.660
Say!

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:32.060
I've been looking forward
to this day.

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:38.470
Because it's the first time
you've asked me out.

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:42.710
I wish she wouldn't be
so happy about it.

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:45.090
I know it's cruel, but...

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:49.850
DOG DOG
DOG DOG DOG

00:19:50.990 --> 00:19:52.750
...it's not cruel enough.

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:58.660
Asuna, I'd like you to stay calm
and listen to what I have to say.

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:01.800
You're young and beautiful.

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:04.340
You come from a fine family,
and you're well-educated.

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:06.200
You're too good for me.

00:20:06.920 --> 00:20:11.440
Please...don't flatter me so much!

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:15.120
W-Wait! I'm not done!
Please! Listen!

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:19.380
I'm not worthy of you!

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:21.620
You're...

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:22.900
the only one for me.

00:20:29.530 --> 00:20:33.200
I knew it when I first met you.

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:35.640
Uh...but you see--

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:36.940
Oh?

00:20:40.310 --> 00:20:41.870
It can't be--!

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:45.080
No! No way!

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:55.550
It's them!

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:59.730
They've traveled so far!
What determination they have!

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:02.860
Here I am, darlings!

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.100
What's the matter?

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:11.840
Let's go somewhere else!!

00:21:11.920 --> 00:21:13.300
But my darlings..!

00:21:13.390 --> 00:21:14.540
You see--

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:28.090
For the fist time in my life...

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:30.450
I'm with a man!

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:32.850
I'm so happy!

00:21:33.700 --> 00:21:36.110
'Til death do us part!

00:21:46.810 --> 00:21:51.450
I suppose he wants me to
listen to the tape... ?

00:22:09.500 --> 00:22:11.220
Hi Kyon-Kyon! How are you?!

00:22:11.910 --> 00:22:13.230
It's me, Mr. Godai!

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:20.850
I love you, too!

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:23.340
That's why I was so happy!

00:22:24.620 --> 00:22:28.680
I was so happy that
I jumped up and down!

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:33.980
I wonder if she understood
my feelings?

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:37.010
Manager.

00:22:39.300 --> 00:22:43.830
But you're too little, Kyon-Kyon,
so I can't make you my bride.

00:22:44.180 --> 00:22:45.030
I'm sorry!

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:48.660
What the hell was he thinking?

00:22:48.740 --> 00:22:52.880
I think he just said
he wouldn't marry you.

00:22:53.590 --> 00:22:56.480
I'm so disgusted,
I think I'm going to fart.

00:23:00.660 --> 00:23:02.850
Godai told me that this
is how he truly feels.

00:23:06.700 --> 00:23:09.430
Kyoko, in all honesty...

00:23:09.870 --> 00:23:13.860
I don't yet have the confidence
to make you happy.

00:23:16.140 --> 00:23:17.020
But--

00:23:18.230 --> 00:23:19.520
What's this?

00:23:19.610 --> 00:23:22.530
Kyoko's preschool teacher
gave it to her.

00:23:23.540 --> 00:23:30.000
But Kyoko... I know
I love you more than anyone.

00:23:30.480 --> 00:23:33.850
Yay!  I'm going to marry Mr. Godai!

00:23:45.970 --> 00:23:49.530
What? Manager and Coach Mitaka
were "doing it"?!

00:23:49.600 --> 00:23:52.390
Yeah! He said they were wrapped
around each other at the condo!

00:23:52.480 --> 00:23:54.590
Can't blame Godai for being
shocked to see that!

00:23:54.680 --> 00:23:58.200
Next: "Caught in the Act!
Kyoko and Mitaka-Hot and Heavy!"

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.900
M-Manager, I--
